# Design system

Canonical file: `design-system/MASTER.md`.

Page work: if `design-system/pages/<page>.md` exists, its rules override Master.

Tokens (cyan canvas, emerald CTA, Lora + Raleway) are in `src/app/globals.css` / `tailwind.config.ts` — do not introduce a second palette.

SQL changes: dated files under `supabase/` (see migrations rule). UI changes: Tailwind + shadcn.
